 On Friday, our colleague Mike Allen sat down with Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent for a wide-ranging interview on "The Axios Show." 

 It includes a revealing exchange from one of President Trump's most trusted economic officials about the challenge of selling a strong economy to Americans frustrated by high prices. More below, or check out the full video and more coverage of what Bessent told us. Plus, France's fiscal troubles are spilling into the currency market. 🇫🇷 💶 Today's newsletter, edited by Jeffrey Cane and copy edited by Katie Lewis, is 985 words, a 3.5-minute read. 

 
 
